    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n101523" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συσχολ-άζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>spend one's leisure with</i> others: <i>to be a
				fellow-pupil in philosophy, study together</i> or
