			<i>fellow-students</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Lib.</u>
				p.35
			</span></i> O., al., cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Lyc.</u>
				16
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Alc.</u>
				24
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀριστάρχῳ -εσχολᾰκώς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phld.
					<u>Acad.Ind.</u>
					p.101
				</span></i>
			 M.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῖς φιλοσόφοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ath.
					4.168a
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Alex.</u>
