			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Jud.Voc.</u>
				8
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Χρυσίππῳ παρὰ Κλεάνθει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ath.
					8.354
				</span></i>
			 e.</div>
